reBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3517740,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3517740","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:54:54Z","value":1125,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5090080","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3517740","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:02Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3517740,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-3517740","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:02Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3517740,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3517740","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:02Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3517740,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1847286114036268","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Play Frostrail Demo Until October 26th","summary":"Hello !The Frostrail demo is live and available for everyone to try until October 26! Since Steam Next Fest began, thousands of you have braved the frozen wilderness, gathered resources and worked together to keep your trains moving. Thank you to everyone who has joined us and shared their experience so far. Your feedback is helping us understand what you enjoy, what needs improving and how we can make Frostrail even better.Here are a few milestones you've helped us reach:110,000 unique players ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:52:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036268","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:26:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1846651706690626","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Demo Out Now!","summary":"You Can Now Play the Frostrail Demo!Hello everyone,Let’s celebrate Steam Next Fest with another chance to play Frostrail for free! If this is your first time aboard, welcome! Invite your best teammates and brave the cold together. Frostrail can be played solo or in co-op with up to four players.Your train is your home. Upgrade it, maintain it, and keep moving forward: your survival depends on it. Along the way, explore abandoned towns to gather resources and craft equipment, food, and weapons. B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:57:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690626","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1846018067926264","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Demo available on October 19 ❄️","summary":"Hi everyone, The Frostrail demo arrives as part of Steam Next Fest, available from October 19 to October 26 🚂 Haven't had the chance to play Frostrail yet? Check out IGN's First Look gameplay video! Since our last playtest, the team has been hard at work going through all of your feedback. Thank you to everyone who jumped aboard and shared their thoughts. Your input is helping us make Frostrail even better! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577624/5852a274fd9206d7e9bebf154ef594eacef13a45.jpg We'll see you al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:08:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1842846814455711","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Closed Beta & 500K Wishlists - Thank You!","summary":"Hi everyone,What a week!70,000+ Playtesters Experienced Frostrail - Thank You!The Frostrail Closed Beta has officially come to an end. We had an incredible time watching more than 70,000 enthusiastic players jump aboard and experience Frostrail.From livestreams to short-form videos, it was wonderful to see how much fun the community had exploring this first glimpse of the game. We’d like to thank each and every one of you for playing and for sharing your valuable feedback throughout the playtest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:55:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455711","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1842212951310304","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Closed Beta Launched!","summary":"Greetings wayfarers! Steam's PvE Survival Crafting Fest has arrived, and so has our Closed Beta! If you're accepted into the Beta or were already a playtester, you should now be able to play and invite your friends to join you. In this article, we’ll share all the information you need! Beta InformationHere is some important information to be aware of before jumping in: The beta end on the 7th of SeptemberThere are no NDA - You can record and stream the content however you like!Play with your Fri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1838407329266266","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Closed Beta Coming on August 31st","summary":"Hello everyone, long time no see!Steam Train Fest is about to begin, and we cannot wait to welcome even more of you aboard as you brave the winter blizzard with your steam-powered train.We are also thrilled to see the amount of wishlist going up: Frostrail will soon reach another milestone!Thank you so much for your enthusiasm, support, and interest in Frostrail. It means a great deal to the entire team.And there is even more exciting news: registrations are now open for our Closed Beta on Augus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T18:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1832700592786224","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"update","title":"Spring Development Update","summary":"Hello everyone! The winter has receded here in northern Europe, but in the world of Frostrail, the cold persists, and so do our development efforts. Let’s take a closer look at how our frosty game has been progressing during the last few months.First closed playtestLast week marked the end of the first closed playtest for Frostrail. It was extremely reassuring to see the excitement towards our game, and over 100,000 applications from eager playtesters! Unfortunately we couldn't grant access to e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T12:45:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786224","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1830797770245126","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"400,000 Wishlists & Playtest Extended!","summary":"Today’s update brings more great news following the start of our closed playtest.We’re incredibly happy to share that Frostrail has now reached 400,000 wishlists on Steam! This is a huge milestone for the team, and we want to thank everyone who has supported the game so far.To celebrate, we’re extending the current playtest until May 4th, giving more of you the opportunity to jump in and experience Frostrail firsthand.We’ve also sent out a new wave of invites, so be sure to keep an eye on your S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T12:23:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770245126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1829528821307285","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Sign Up for the Playtest","summary":"Today’s blog brings you news of our upcoming closed playtest. In the time since we held a limited playtest back in November, development has steadily progressed to a point where we have a solid core experience and foundation for our game. This means that we are ready to get Frostrail into the hands of a larger number of players. The playtest will run from April 16th to April 27th and will focus on collecting feedback on the early game loop and Frostrail’s Fun Factor (or FFF for the real ones). T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T16:03:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821307285","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1826992588592579","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frostrail Reaches 300,000 Wishlists","summary":"We’re delighted to share that Frostrail has now been wishlisted over 300,000 times on Steam!A huge thank you to everyone who has taken the time to add Frostrail to their wishlist. It means a lot to the team, and we’re incredibly excited to see so many of you looking forward to getting your hands on the game.We’ve also just released a brand-new gameplay trailer, so be sure to check it out if you haven’t already.Stay tuned for more news and reveals in the coming months!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T14:37:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588592579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1825727806710888","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch The New Frostrail Gameplay Trailer","summary":"Your train is your lifeline. The tracks are your only way forward.Watch the brand-new gameplay trailer for Frostrail, a ruthless open-world survival crafting FPS from FakeFish, creators of Barotrauma.Explore, scavenge, craft, and fight to endure a frozen, corrupted world alone or in co-op. Operate and upgrade your steam-powered train as you push through an unforgiving wasteland where every stop, every encounter, and every decision can mean the difference between survival and the end of the line.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-27T14:36:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806710888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1818118366182621","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"update","title":"Winter Development Update","summary":"Hello everyone!While we have been quiet on this front, behind the scenes the wheels of development are constantly turning, and we wanted to share some greetings and a progress update on Frostrail’s development with you before the year is out. This year has been action-packed for our studio. We’ve revisited pretty much every corner of the game: redrawing and improving huge chunks of art assets, expanding our lore and documentation, laying the foundations for campaign progression, and homing in on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-08T13:59:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366182621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1807332909733537","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"update","title":"Summer Update & Gamescom","summary":"Hello everyone!We have just returned to our desks from our summer holidays, and work continues on our less than summery game. Since our reveal in the spring, a lot of things have fallen into place with Frostrail, and we are eager to show you more of them a little later. Over the past months, the combat gameplay in particular has improved by leaps and bounds. We’ve spent a lot of time honing the feel of combat, adjusting animations, sounds and enemy mechanics to find the perfect mix of fantasy an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-12T13:54:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909733537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1802354289725734","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank YOU for 200,000 wishlists!","summary":"Hello everyone! Today’s blog post is a shorter one, but an important one nevertheless. We’re delighted to share that Frostrail has been wishlisted over 200,000 times! At the time of writing, the reveal trailer has almost reached 450,000 views on YouTube. It’s a great achievement to see these kinds of numbers just two months after revealing the game. You’ve made us feel very proud of what we’re working on!On behalf of everyone at FakeFish, thank you for taking the time to add Frostrail to your wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-17T14:30:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802354289725734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1797820624460307","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Frequently Asked Questions about Frostrail","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577624/7580bfa45546f90ca3b4ea19a8202308368f47f9.png Hello everyone! Now that we’ve had a couple of weeks to read through your comments and questions, we wanted to reply to a few of the most frequently asked ones. Have a read below, and post in the comments here or on Discord if you have anything else on your mind that you’d like to know. Frostrail FAQ When is Frostrail releasing? Frostrail is planned to be released into Early Access on Steam in 2026. Will there be a public p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-24T13:01:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797820624460307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1797185861638334","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the team behind Frostrail","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577624/be937dc80aa950897cd60beafa2f9aeaf66c772c.png Hello everyone! We’ve been thrilled to see so much interest in Frostrail since last week’s announcement. Thank you for all the questions and comments, and keep them coming – we’re looking forward to hearing what you think, and will be writing to answer as many questions as we can in the coming weeks and months. This week we wanted to help you get to know us a little better: You may have heard of FakeFish before, but what ki","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-17T12:42:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797185861638334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517740-1796631172250079","game_id":"steam-3517740","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Frostrail, a journey through the cold","summary":"Greetings wayfarer, and welcome on board. You’ve just taken your first step on the journey called Frostrail, and we’re thrilled to have you with us! Let’s talk a little bit about this game that we at FakeFish and Shiro Games have been working on for a couple of years already, behind the scenes. Frostrail is the upcoming second game of FakeFish, the Finnish game studio behind the submarine simulator Barotrauma. Frostrail is an entirely new survival horror adventure through the cold and dark – not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-10T16:05:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"http